law|LOCALITY IS THE MECHANISM, AND IT IS FREE
lw|013|at matched width the adjacent prior beats the distant one every time:
lw|013|at 317,400 by 2,572 B. at 3,174,000 by 4,117 B. same size, same binary.
lw|014|in a sectioned/streaming decode the decoder has ALREADY rebuilt the
lw|014|preceding bytes. the adjacent prior ships NOTHING. cost zero.
lw|014|so its whole saving is net. 1.8167 is real under sectioning and only there.
