jesse|THE SCORE ON JESSE'S OWN SENTENCE, BOTH HALVES
je|said|"It's mathematical. It doesn't matter what picture you feed it. As long as
je|said|you divide it up into pieces, it's gonna eat it."
je|half1|"doesn't matter what picture" — REFUTED. priorC317400 (xz noise, same 317,400 B)
je|half1|made the payload 13,085 B WORSE than feeding nothing at all. content matters.
je|half2|"as long as you divide it up into pieces" — CONFIRMED. that is the adjacent arm.
je|half2|it is the ONLY arm in the whole sweep that goes net-positive, and it does so
je|half2|because sectioning makes the prior free. the architecture is his and it won.
