err|DOCUMENTATION ERROR FOUND AND CORRECTED THIS RUN
er|1|run_prior_sweep.sh says prior317400.bin is "enwik8[90,000,000 ..]". it is not.
er|1|prior31740, prior317400 and prior3174000 ALL begin at enwik8 offset 94,371,840.
er|1|that is 90 MiB (90 x 2^20), not 90,000,000 decimal.
er|2|prior3174.bin alone is at 90,000,000 decimal. so the KEY is NOT a prefix of the
er|2|larger priors and the four sizes are NOT a nested series. verified by sha:
er|2|head -c 3174 of all three larger priors = fc2aa2a2f0cfd250; the key = 1be91cb7.
er|3|consequence: the size axis mixes a size change with a content change at the
er|3|first point. the trend survives (three nested points still fall monotonically)
er|3|but the 3174 row is off-curve by provenance and must be labelled that way.

